  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child protection UNICEF - Child protection programme UNICEF-thematic 2018 to 2021</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Child protection UNICEF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNICEF core/thematic programme in BIH has the overall objective (Outcome 2 of Country programme) that child protection systems are strengthened to prevent and respond to cases of violence, abuse, exploitation, and neglect of children, including institutionalization, and specifically to the following outputs and results: &#xa0;
OUTPUT 1:&#xa0; Strengthened children and their families capacity to demand child protection services
OUTPUT 2: Service providers better equipped to deliver child protection services
OUTPUT 3. Children at risk, child victims and witnesses of crime, children as parties in civil and administrative proceedings and children in conflict with the law better served and protected&#xa0;
End</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF har ans&#xf6;kt hos Sida f&#xf6;r 15 miljoner SEK i finansiering f&#xf6;r att utf&#xf6;ra implementeringen av UNICEF:s aktiviteter inom det tematiska omr&#xe5;det &#x201d;Child Protection&#x201d; i BiH som en del av UNICEF:s strategiska plan 2018-2021 och som skissades i UNICEF Country Program Document 2015-2020 i Bosnien och Hercegovina. 

M&#xe5;len f&#xf6;r programmet &#xe4;r:
-Till 2019, ett &#xf6;kat antal flickor och pojkar anv&#xe4;nder ett kontinuum av tj&#xe4;nster inom barnskydd riktade att f&#xf6;rhindra och ge adekvat respons p&#xe5; v&#xe5;ld, f&#xf6;rsummande, missf&#xf6;rh&#xe5;llanden och familjeseparation, och att r&#xe4;ttvis tillg&#xe5;ng till r&#xe4;ttvisa f&#xf6;r alla barn st&#xe4;rks.
-St&#xe4;rka barnen och deras familjers kapacitet att kr&#xe4;va barnskyddstj&#xe4;nster. 
-Att service givare &#xe4;r b&#xe4;ttre utrustad att leverera barnskyddstj&#xe4;nstera. 
-Att barn i riskzonen, barn som &#xe4;r offer och vittnen till brott, barn som &#xe4;r del av civilr&#xe4;ttsliga och administrativa framfaranden och barn i konflikt med lagen &#xe4;r b&#xe4;ttre omh&#xe4;ndertagna och skyddade.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF has applied to Sida for funding of 15 million SEK to carry out the implementation of UNICEF&apos;s activities within the thematic area &quot;Child Protection&quot; in BiH as part of the UNICEF Strategic Plan 2018-2021 and as outlined in the UNICEF Country Programme Document 2015-2020 in Bosnia and Herzegovina.   

The objectives of the Programme are:
-- By 2019, an increased number of boys and girls use  a continuum of child protection services aimed at preventing and adequately responding to violence, neglect and abuse and family separation, and equitable access to justice is strengthened for all children.
-- Strengthened children and their families&#x2019; capacity to demand child protection services
-- Service providers better equipped to deliver child protection services
-- Children at- risk, child victims and witnesses of crime, children as parties in civil and administrative proceedings and children in conflict with the law better served and protected</narrative>
  </description>
